            "en": "Lighting and sound setup, steady framing and relaxed interviewees."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "cadrage-3",
          "label": {
            "fr": "Événementiel & concerts",
            "en": "Events & concerts"
          },
          "explanation": {
            "fr": "Je me fonds dans l'événement pour capter l'ambiance sans jamais gêner.",
            "en": "I blend into the event to capture the vibe without ever being in the way."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "cadrage-4",
          "label": {
            "fr": "Images d'illustration",
            "en": "B-roll & illustration footage"
          },
          "explanation": {
            "fr": "Plans d'appui (b-roll) qui enrichissent le montage et racontent le contexte.",
            "en": "Supporting shots that enrich the edit and tell the context."
